WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Start with the application landscape.
Payment services offer a bounded API

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:08.400
surface for the pilot. Web and mobile
journeys retain their own checks,

00:00:08.413 --> 00:00:11.600
while provider integration
and settlement have separate constraints.

00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:15.200
Today, the scenario has few
shared environments and no

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:18.880
backend virtualization.
The proposed payment pilot

00:00:18.931 --> 00:00:22.720
introduces controlled provider
behavior and per-run isolation.

00:00:22.987 --> 00:00:26.720
It does not automatically solve
mobile-device availability,

00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:30.320
legacy batch scheduling or every
vendor integration requirement.
